flowchart TD
    A[User browses a job page] --> B[Click Browser Companion]
    B --> C[Read active tab only]
    C --> D[URL + page title]
    C --> E[JobPosting JSON-LD]
    C --> F[Selected / visible text]
    D --> G[POST browser companion capture]
    E --> G
    F --> G
    G --> H[Authenticate revocable companion token]
    H --> I[Raw Job Listing]
    I --> J[Normal ingestion pipeline]
    J --> K[Normalize]
    K --> L[Validate]
    L --> M[Deduplicate]
    M --> N{Known job?}
    N -->|Yes| O[Attach / update listing]
    N -->|No| P[Create canonical job]
    O --> Q{User action}
    P --> Q
    Q -->|Save| R[Save to job inbox]
    Q -->|Applied| S[Create application]
    S --> T[ApplicationEvent: APPLIED]
